<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian money market supply cut in week.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian money market supply cut in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank said it withdrew liquidity from the money market in the week to July 18 (figures from the weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   452.486 ( + 0.324)</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  22.878 ( - 0.042)</p>
<p> Commercial bills			  2.299 ( - 0.025)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   25.793 ( - 0.002)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 114.830 ( - 0.731)</p>
<p> Bank notes in circulation	   482.943 ( + 0.108)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
